Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,what the f***?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,could the 76ers beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:03.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,the celtics if boston
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:05.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,played in swim flippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:06.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,last night, boston
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,beat philly by 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,philly's biggest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,lead all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:11.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:11.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,boston's?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:12.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,29.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:13.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,so philly asked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:14.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,for a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:16.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,with one small change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:18.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,boston plays in flippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:19.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,tip-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:20.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,the celtics flap down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,the court like penguins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:22.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,paul george, who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:23.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,dropped 36 last
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:25.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,night, still can't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:26.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,in flippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:27.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,okay, boston gets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,life jackets too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:29.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,they can barely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,bend their arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:32.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,boston's up 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:33.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,philly calls timeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:34.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,philly asks the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:35.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,referee for more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:36.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,new rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:37.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,boston plays
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:38.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,from a canoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:38.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,two celtics
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:40.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,paddle, one shoots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:41.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,swish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:41.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,the canoe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:42.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,is shooting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,better than philly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:45.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,boston's up 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:46.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,jaylen brown, playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:46.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,his old team for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,the first time, just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:49.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,stares at the canoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,the philly crowd starts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:52.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,cheering for the canoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score, celtics
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:56.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,123, sixers 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:56.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,the exact same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.98,0:00:58.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,score as last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:58.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,the flippers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:00.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,changed nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:00.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,the life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:01.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,jackets changed nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,the canoe changed nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,philly is now 9-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:06.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:07.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,boston plays underwater.
